services=[
('drain-sewer-cleaning','Drain & sewer cleaning','Get things flowing again.','Slow drains, recurring clogs, and backed-up sewer lines call for more than another temporary fix. Ed’s offers drain cleaning, power rodding, and hydro jetting throughout Chicago and the suburbs.','01', [('When to give us a call','A sink that drains slowly, a gurgling pipe, or a toilet that repeatedly backs up can point to a blockage. Let us know which fixtures are affected and whether the problem has happened before.'),('A closer look at the blockage','The right approach depends on the drain, the condition of the pipe, and the obstruction. Ask about power rodding and hydro jetting, including our custom drain cleaning equipment.'),('One drain or the whole house?','A single slow fixture and several fixtures backing up at once may need different approaches. Describe what you are seeing when you call so we can discuss the next step.')]),
('plumbing-repairs','Plumbing repairs & installations','Small leak. Big priority.','From a dripping faucet to a worn-out fixture, get help with the plumbing you depend on every day. Arrange plumbing repairs and installations in Chicago, Darien, and the surrounding suburbs.','02',[('Everyday plumbing, taken care of','Talk to us about faucets, sinks, toilets, showers, bathtubs, garbage disposals, and pipe replacement. We can help you plan a repair or discuss replacing a fixture that no longer meets your needs.'),('Planning an installation','Have the fixture model, the room location, and a description of the existing plumbing ready when you call. If you already purchased a fixture, ask about compatibility before arranging installation.'),('More than fixtures','Our installation services also include water lines, sewer lines, water softeners, well pumps, and gas lines. Call to discuss the scope of your project and arrange an in-home consultation.')]),
('water-heaters','Water heater replacement','Bring comfort back home.','When it is time for a new water heater, Ed’s can help with installation and replacement. Call to discuss your current system and your household’s hot-water needs.','03',[('Time to talk about a replacement?','Tell us about leaking around the unit, inconsistent hot water, or a system that no longer keeps up. These details help frame the conversation about your existing equipment.'),('Plan around your home','Tank size, fuel type, available space, and the existing connections all matter. An in-home consultation helps establish what installation will involve before work is scheduled.'),('What to have ready','If it is safe and accessible, note the brand and model of your existing water heater. Let us know where it is installed and whether you have noticed water around it.')]),
('sump-pumps','Sump pump installation','Keep your basement in mind.','Plan ahead with sump pump installation and replacement for your Chicagoland home. Speak with Ed’s about your current setup and the work your basement needs.','04',[('Replace an existing sump pump','If your pump is making unusual noises, running frequently, or no longer operating as expected, call to discuss replacement. Share the pump’s age if you know it and any recent changes you have noticed.'),('A new installation','A new sump pump project depends on the space and existing drainage setup. Arrange a consultation to discuss access, the sump pit, and the discharge connection.'),('Get ahead of the next project','Take note of previous basement water issues and how your current system behaves. That context helps make the appointment more useful.')]),
('home-repairs-remodeling','Home repairs & remodeling','A better home starts here.','The same number for your next home project. Alongside plumbing and sewer work, Ed’s offers home repairs and remodeling across Chicagoland.','05',[('Rooms ready for a fresh start','Discuss kitchen, bathroom, or basement remodeling, from the initial scope to the plumbing work the project requires. Bring your ideas and priorities to an in-home consultation.'),('Inside and outside','Our services include decks, patios, garages, carpentry, masonry, tiling, roofing, and electrical work. Call to confirm the details and availability for your particular project.'),('Start with the scope','Tell us what you want to change, where the work is needed, and your preferred timing. Photos, measurements, and a list of priorities can help guide the conversation.')])]
