faqs=[('Do you serve my part of Chicagoland?','We serve Chicago and the Chicago suburbs from our Darien location. Call with your town or ZIP code and the work you need so we can confirm scheduling for your address.'),('Can I call for emergency plumbing service?','Yes. 24-hour emergency service is available by phone. Call (630) 663-1444 to explain the problem and confirm availability. Regular office hours are Monday through Friday, 9 am to 5 pm.'),('Do you handle more than plumbing?','Yes. You can also contact Ed’s about home repairs and remodeling, including kitchens, bathrooms, basements, and exterior projects.'),('How do I schedule service?','Call (630) 663-1444. Share your location, describe the issue or project, and discuss an appointment. For installations and remodeling, ask about an in-home consultation.')]
