home=f'''<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="red-line"></span>YOUR CHICAGOLAND PLUMBER</p><h1>Good work.<br>Honest service.<br><em>That’s Ed’s.</em></h1><p>From stubborn drains to your next home project.<br class="desktop"> Plumbing and sewer service for Chicago and the suburbs, with pride in every job.</p><div class="actions">{btn()}<a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore our services <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span>★</span> Local service. All-American pride.</div></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/flag.gif" alt="American flag, reflecting Ed’s patriotic spirit" width="985" height="400" fetchpriority="high"><div class="art-label">ROOTED IN CHICAGOLAND.<br><strong>Ready to get to work.</strong></div><div class="service-seal"><span>ED’S PLUMBING & SEWER</span><strong>★</strong><span>CHICAGO & THE SUBURBS</span></div><div class="art-caption"><span>PLUMBING · SEWER · HOME REPAIRS</span><span>EST. IN HARD WORK</span></div></div></div></section><div class="trust-bar"><div class="wrap"><span><b>✓</b> Up-front pricing</span><span><b>✓</b> Emergency service available</span><span><b>✓</b> Plumbing & home repairs</span><span><b>★</b> Proudly serving Chicagoland</span></div></div><section class="section wrap" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT CAN WE HELP WITH?</p><h2>One call. A lot taken care of.</h2></div><p>Everyday repairs. Unexpected problems.<br>A fresh start for your home.</p></div>{cards()}</section><section class="local-section"><div class="wrap local-grid"><div class="local-art"><div class="local-coordinates">DARIEN, ILLINOIS / CHICAGOLAND</div><div class="big-star">★</div><h2>Your home.<br>Our hometown<br>commitment.</h2><span class="local-stripes"></span></div><div class="local-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A LOCAL NAME. A HANDS-ON APPROACH.</p><h2>Big-city reach.<br>Neighborly service.</h2><p>A plumbing problem can turn your whole day upside down. Getting help should be straightforward.</p><p>Based in Darien, Ed’s Plumbing and Sewer Inc. serves homes throughout Chicago and the suburbs. Call us about the issue, talk through the work, and take the next step with a clear plan.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know Ed’s <span>→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section wrap area"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE CITY TO THE SUBURBS</p><h2>Chicagoland.<br>We’re in your corner.</h2><p>Based in Darien. Serving Chicago and communities throughout the surrounding suburbs.</p><a class="text-link" href="/service-area/">Explore our service area <span>→</span></a></div><div class="towns"><span>Chicago</span><span>Darien</span><span>Downers Grove</span><span>Naperville</span><span>Woodridge</span><span>Westmont</span><span>Hinsdale</span><span>Oak Brook</span><span>Bolingbrook</span><span>Lisle</span><span>Elmhurst</span><span>And beyond ↗</span><p>Don’t see your town? Call us with your ZIP code.</p></div></section><section class="faq-section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW HELPFUL ANSWERS</p><h2>Before you<br>give us a call.</h2></div>{faq}</div></section>'''
